ection><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>主办：北京大学全球健康发展研究院</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>北京大学全球健康发展研究院（全健院）成立于2020年，由北京大学国发院教育部长江学者特聘教授、中国医学科学院学部委员刘国恩老师担任创始院长；作为北京大学实体交叉研究机构，全健院聚集北京大学健康经济、医疗卫生、国际关系、气候环境等多学科力量，以跨越国界的视角把全球健康置于人类发展的框架，以“同一世界、同一健康”为核心理念，通过科学研究、人才培养、国际合作、产教融合等平台，探索人类健康重大议题的应对方案，推动中国积极参与全球卫生治理，助力构建人类健康发展共同体。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>协办：耶鲁北京中心</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>耶鲁北京中心（Yale Center Beijing）旨在助力耶鲁大学实现致力于为社会各界和全球各地区培养领袖的愿景。凭借耶鲁大学作为全球性研究型大学的丰富资源和其历来与中国的紧密联系，中心旨在促进决策者和思想领袖们就全球各种紧迫问题开展建设性对话及坦率交流。中心帮助耶鲁扩展现有活动，与位于中国的机构和组织加强合作关系，支持耶鲁各个学院和部门的研究和教学活动。中心由耶鲁大学管理学院代表耶鲁大学进行管理。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏校简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span><span>北京大学全球健康发展研究院与耶鲁北京中心联合举办2026年“北京大学-耶鲁大学‘AI赋能星球健康’经济学夏校”（\"AI for Planetary Health\"  Economics Summer Instutite），为全球健康、健康经济学、卫生政策与管理等相关领域的优秀青年学者提供一周的集体学习机会。在北京大学举办，时间为2026年7月12日-16日（开幕式暂定12日傍晚）。</span></span></span></section><p><span><span>入选参加此次夏校的学员，将赴北京大学参加线下学术活动。夏校将邀请来自包含北京大学、耶鲁大学等高校的国内外顶尖学者、科学家、企业家授课，并围绕“AI赋能星球健康”这一前沿经济学议题开展学习与交流。夏校期间，除论坛讲座外，还将安排参访中国科学院大气物理研究所、世界卫生组织北京代表处及耶鲁北京中心等国际组织与学术机构。</span></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏校择优录取30人，不收取任何费用，住宿、往返交通自理。同时，此次夏校为每位学员提供奖助金，北京市内学员500元；外地学员2500元。学习期间，夏校将为学员提供餐饮安排（包括午餐、晚餐及茶歇）。夏校组织方将为全体参校学员统一购买保险。</span></span></p><p><span><span>有意报名北京大学全球健康发展研究院全国优秀大学生夏令营的同学建议同步报名此夏校，且需于北京大学研究生院报名全球健康发展研究院全国优秀大学生夏令营（预计5月初发布相关通知）。同时，优秀学员还有机会获得北京大学青年卫生经济学者研究奖学金与北京大学全球健康发展青年学者奖励项目推荐资格，支持其在北京大学中国卫生经济研究中心深造1-2年。本次夏校将开放少量观察员名额，可通过申请以观察员身份参与部分活动，食宿交通等自理。详细情况，访问全健院www.ghd.pku.edu.cn；或https://ccher.nsd.pku.edu.cn/zxjj/fwxzxm/index.htm.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招收对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、遵纪守法，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、境内外高校的高年级本科生、硕士研究生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、具有经济学、公共卫生、大数据等相关专业背景，对科研工作具有浓厚兴趣；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4、英语水平良好，具备利用英语进行科研、写作以及交流的能力。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><sectio